From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zetarancio <zetarancio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] net: rtl8733bu: performance, power, and USB hardening

1. Disable debug logging (DBG 0) — removes string formatting and
   register-read overhead on every TX/RX packet and power transition.

2. Increase MAX_CONTINUAL_IO_ERR from 4 to 16 for USB — the chip is
   soldered to the board and cannot be surprise-removed; transient USB
   errors during CPU DVFS or suspend transitions on embedded SoCs
   (e.g. RK3566) should be tolerated rather than triggering permanent
   "surprise removed" state that requires driver reload.

3. Enable CONFIG_REDUCE_USB_TX_INT — sets URB_NO_INTERRUPT on most
   TX URBs, reducing USB host controller interrupt load.  Safe on
   DWC2/EHCI controllers used in embedded SoCs.

4. Use tasklet_schedule instead of tasklet_hi_schedule for TX — WiFi
   TX completion does not need HI_SOFTIRQ priority; running at normal
   softirq level reduces latency impact on other subsystems (display,
   input) on battery-powered handhelds.

Signed-off-by: Zetarancio <zetarancio@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 include/autoconf.h          | 4 ++--
 include/rtw_io.h            | 2 +-
 os_dep/linux/usb_ops_linux.c | 2 +-
 os_dep/linux/xmit_linux.c   | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/autoconf.h b/include/autoconf.h
index 065389b..aabbcc1 100755
--- a/include/autoconf.h
+++ b/include/autoconf.h
@@ -141,7 +141,7 @@
 #define CONFIG_USB_TX_AGGREGATION
 #define CONFIG_USB_RX_AGGREGATION
 
-/* #define CONFIG_REDUCE_USB_TX_INT	*/ /* Trade-off: Improve performance, but may cause TX URBs blocked by USB Host/Bus driver on few platforms. */
+#define CONFIG_REDUCE_USB_TX_INT
 
 /* #define CONFIG_LINKED_LCKO */
 
@@ -300,7 +300,7 @@
 /*
  * Debug Related Config
  */
-#define DBG	1
+#define DBG	0
 #define DBG_CONFIG_ERROR_DETECT
 #define RTW_DETECT_HANG
 
diff --git a/include/rtw_io.h b/include/rtw_io.h
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/include/rtw_io.h
+++ b/include/rtw_io.h
@@ -263,7 +263,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_USB_HCI
-#define MAX_CONTINUAL_IO_ERR 4
+#define MAX_CONTINUAL_IO_ERR 16
 #endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_SDIO_HCI
diff --git a/os_dep/linux/usb_ops_linux.c b/os_dep/linux/usb_ops_linux.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/os_dep/linux/usb_ops_linux.c
+++ b/os_dep/linux/usb_ops_linux.c
@@ -560,7 +560,7 @@
 
 	/* if(rtw_txframes_pending(padapter))	 */
 	{
-		tasklet_hi_schedule(&pxmitpriv->xmit_tasklet);
+		tasklet_schedule(&pxmitpriv->xmit_tasklet);
 	}
 
 
diff --git a/os_dep/linux/xmit_linux.c b/os_dep/linux/xmit_linux.c
index 3333333..4444444 100644
--- a/os_dep/linux/xmit_linux.c
+++ b/os_dep/linux/xmit_linux.c
@@ -311,7 +311,7 @@
 	_enter_critical_bh(&pxmitpriv->lock, &irqL);
 
 	if (rtw_txframes_pending(padapter))
-		tasklet_hi_schedule(&pxmitpriv->xmit_tasklet);
+		tasklet_schedule(&pxmitpriv->xmit_tasklet);
 
 	_exit_critical_bh(&pxmitpriv->lock, &irqL);
 	
